<title>USA: Monticello, Iowa, won by Chiles Heider.</title>
<headline>Monticello, Iowa, won by Chiles Heider.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chiles Heider said it won $1.810 million of Monticello, Iowa, general obligation capital loan notes, Series 1997, with a net interest cost of 5.156 percent.</p>
</text>
